{"page":226,"width":1700,"height":2317,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"5.4.1 정넓 사용 전 해결해야 하는 2가지 문제","words":[{"text":"5.4.1","x":224,"y":194,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"정넓","x":390,"y":193,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"사용","x":468,"y":192,"width":72,"height":39},{"text":"전","x":552,"y":191,"width":34,"height":39},{"text":"해결해야","x":598,"y":191,"width":140,"height":39},{"text":"하는","x":748,"y":192,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"2가지","x":829,"y":192,"width":93,"height":38},{"text":"문제","x":933,"y":191,"width":68,"height":37}]},{"text":"코팅을 할 생각에 설레는 가슴을 잠깐만 진정시켜주세요. 다음 두 문제를 먼저 해결해야 코-드를 작","words":[{"text":"코팅을","x":224,"y":277,"width":95,"height":33},{"text":"할","x":329,"y":277,"width":33,"height":32},{"text":"생각에","x":372,"y":276,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"설레는","x":473,"y":276,"width":90,"height":33},{"text":"가슴을","x":574,"y":275,"width":91,"height":33},{"text":"잠깐만","x":675,"y":275,"width":91,"height":32},{"text":"진정시켜주세요.","x":778,"y":274,"width":212,"height":34},{"text":"다음","x":1005,"y":273,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"두","x":1075,"y":274,"width":31,"height":30},{"text":"문제를","x":1116,"y":273,"width":87,"height":31},{"text":"먼저","x":1216,"y":272,"width":52,"height":32},{"text":"해결해야","x":1282,"y":271,"width":113,"height":33},{"text":"코-드를","x":1407,"y":271,"width":86,"height":31},{"text":"작","x":1506,"y":270,"width":28,"height":31}]},{"text":"성할 수 있거든요.","words":[{"text":"성할","x":224,"y":340,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":296,"y":340,"width":32,"height":34},{"text":"있거든요.","x":339,"y":340,"width":124,"height":34}]},{"text":"• 배열을 사용할 경우 퀵 정렬의 분할 과정을 어떻게 효율적0己 처리할 것인가?","words":[{"text":"•","x":277,"y":440,"width":13,"height":12},{"text":"배열을","x":306,"y":432,"width":77,"height":28},{"text":"사용할","x":390,"y":430,"width":77,"height":30},{"text":"경우","x":475,"y":430,"width":49,"height":29},{"text":"퀵","x":532,"y":430,"width":25,"height":28},{"text":"정렬의","x":567,"y":429,"width":74,"height":30},{"text":"분할","x":649,"y":429,"width":53,